        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921956_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>、<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>……\n嗯嗯，是和我的心之友大兜丸一样\n好记的名字。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921956_content",
                "value": "<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>、<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>……\n嗯嗯，是和我的心之友大兜丸一样\n好记的名字。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1665921956
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921957_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "这是、你给我宝贵食物的<style=Highlight>回礼</style>。\n十分感谢——",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921957_content",
                "value": "这是、你给我宝贵食物的<style=Highlight>回礼</style>。\n十分感谢——"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": "伊佐奇点头沉吟\n{A点头}",
              "textGuid": 1665921957
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921958_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "对了，大兜丸也一起过来打招呼嗯。\n虽然，听不太懂身为<style=Highlight>甲虫</style>的大兜丸说什么，\n但，只要心意相……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921958_content",
                "value": "对了，大兜丸也一起过来打招呼嗯。\n虽然，听不太懂身为<style=Highlight>甲虫</style>的大兜丸说什么，\n但，只要心意相……"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": "发“回礼”\n（具体内容等策划）",
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": "伊佐奇送出给礼物",
              "textGuid": 1665921958
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921959_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "嗯呜？等等……我这一路上……\n<style=SizeBig>是要找大兜丸来着？！</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921959_content",
                "value": "嗯呜？等等……我这一路上……\n<style=SizeBig>是要找大兜丸来着？！</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1665921959
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921960_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "嗯唔——就算已经找了三天三夜，\n完——全没有吃饭睡觉，\n我——也不会放弃！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921960_content",
                "value": "嗯唔——就算已经找了三天三夜，\n完——全没有吃饭睡觉，\n我——也不会放弃！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": "伊佐奇超惊讶\n{A惊讶}",
              "textGuid": 1665921960
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921961_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "一定找到你——\n<style=SizeBig>大兜丸！！</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921961_content",
                "value": "一定找到你——\n<style=SizeBig>大兜丸！！</style>"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": "说到和大兜丸失散，伊佐奇气势汹汹表达自己的犟\n{A生气}",
              "textGuid": 1665921961
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "伊佐奇",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921962_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "下次碰到<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>的时候，\n一定能顺利把大兜丸介绍给你认识。\n回头见、是也！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_201000402_1665921962_content",
                "value": "下次碰到<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>的时候，\n一定能顺利把大兜丸介绍给你认识。\n回头见、是也！"
              },
